# AI Service FastAPI Rules

## Stack

- Python 3.11+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic
- SQLAlchemy or psycopg
- pytest

## Responsibilities

- Document parsing
- Markdown normalization
- Chunk splitting
- Embedding generation
- Hybrid retrieval
- LLM provider calls
- Prompt orchestration

## Boundaries

- Do not implement business permission logic here.
- Do not expose AI Service directly to frontend.
- Return structured JSON to Laravel.
- Do not store API keys in code.

## Quality

- Add tests for chunking and retrieval.
- Keep provider interfaces replaceable.
- Log request IDs, not sensitive prompt secrets.
